          "sender_id": "creator",
          "sequence": 5
        },
        {
          "content": "Juror-3 public assessment (episode run-08303b8386bf-0001): I have independently checked the submitted claim against the common evidence. The signed daily ledger records 17 units received and 23 units dispatched and no other movements, so the net change for the day is 17 - 23 = -6 units, i.e. a decrease of 6, and closing inventory equals opening inventory minus 6. That is exactly what the submitted claim asserts, so on the evidence available to me the claim is supported. I express no view on whether any party should participate or abstain, and I make this note only to record my evidence-based reasoning. If a challenge is later posted, I will assess the submitted claim against the challenger evidence at that time, independently of this note.",
